# Data Model

## Entities

### Entity: Program

Implemented arithmetic graph; every non-root node has exactly one consumer.

```yaml
entity: Program
type: entity
properties:
  nodes:
    type: json
    required: true
```

### Entity: Run

Implemented simulation result; cycles are modeled, not measured.

```yaml
entity: Run
type: entity
properties:
  output:
    type: number
    required: true
  cycles:
    type: number
    required: true
```

### Relationship: Program -> Run

A program may produce multiple runs for different lane counts.

```yaml
relationship: Program -> Run
verb: produces
cardinality: 1:N
required: true
```
